    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge between abstract ideas and practical problem-solving—something I enjoy when it’s applied creatively, like in art or coding. It’s not intimidating for me; instead, it’s a tool that helps me think logically. My parents didn’t emphasize math heavily, but my openness to learning (Ocean score: 70) lets me explore its beauty beyond just numbers.",
